        "notes": "This game is a visual novel in the horror genre with elements of psychological tension. The story touches on dark themes such as violence, extreme violence, suicide, self-harm, trauma, and the consequences of actions taken by the characters. There are scenes depicting psychological suffering and morally challenging decisions that can significantly impact the development of the plot. These elements are an integral part of the story and are intended for a mature audience."
